    <p class="eyebrow">Wednesday AM · P4 · AI Harness Bootcamp</p>
    <h1>The director&#x27;s operating harness</h1>
    <p class="lede">Turn one recurring knowledge goal into a personal, bounded system that can finish useful work, prove the result, survive a fresh context, and stop cleanly. The vault is the work product. The loop, state, evaluator, and verifier are the harness that make it dependable.</p>

    <div class="meta-grid">
      <div><span class="k">Day</span><span class="v">Wednesday AM</span></div>
      <div><span class="k">Block</span><span class="v">P4</span></div>
      <div><span class="k">Time</span><span class="v">~2 hr 45 min + 45 min case talk</span></div>
      <div><span class="k">Tools</span><span class="v">Codex app (<code>gpt-5.6-terra</code>) + Obsidian + Python verifier</span></div>
      <div><span class="k">Your progress</span><span class="v v-mono" data-progress-for="ahb-checklist-p4">0 / 12 · 0%</span></div>
    </div>
